# Generated frontend build output.
#
# The compiled plugin assets are produced by `npm run build` in
# ../../frontend (Vite writes them here, and `emptyOutDir` clears this folder
# on every build). They are collected at deployment time via
# `invoke collectplugins` and shipped through the setuptools `package-data`
# declared in pyproject.toml, so they are not tracked in git.
static/
